														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-1878322">
									

<p>Just wanted to thank everyone who looked at this, and give credit to the artists. The photo of the empty room and the bulb are stock photos, and the picture of the SCP-1619–1 was taken from the humanoid category from the visual records.</p>
<p>However, regarding the two pictures featuring –2-C instances (<a href="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/scp-1619/Catlamp.jpg">this</a> one and <a href="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/scp-1619/Catlamp2.jpg">this</a>), those are the MiCha Lamps (photo: V.Warin), and I’d like to thank the artists for allowing me to write about them. More information about these beauties can be found at <a href="http://www.houseofmicha.com/en/">http://www.houseofmicha.com/en/</a>. I urge you all to check em’ out, they’re pretty awesome!</p>
<p>And thanks for reading! <span style="color: white">(≡O≡)</span></p>

							</div>

								
